<row><cell>darunter</cell><cell>56,2</cell><cell>pCt.</cell><cell>männliche,</cell></row><lb/>
<row><cell/><cell>43,8</cell><cell>weibliche,</cell></row><lb/>
</table> <p>oder in absoluten Zahlen:</p><lb/>
